34 Commencement.—(1) This Act comes into force on such day as the Secretary of State appoints by regulations
made by statutory instrument, subject to subsection (3).
(2) Regulations under subsection (1) may appoint different days for different purposes.
(3) The following provisions come into force on the day on which this Act is passed—
(a)
section 3(2) to (7);
(b)
section 9;
(c)
section 24(4) and (5);
(d)
section 28(1);
(e)
section 30(12);
(f)
section 31;
(g)
section 33;
(h)
this section;
(i)
section 35.

